Position: Dental Hygienist
Location: Steenwijk – The Netherlands

Information about the employer:
Steenwijkerdiep is a dental practice in Steenwijk. Our modern group practice offers a broad scope of dental care, delivered by a multidisciplinary team of dentists, dental hygienists, and dental assistants. Using advanced equipment and high-quality materials, we strive to provide the highest standard of care.

Information about the position:
As our Dental Hygienist, you play a key role in helping patients achieve and maintain excellent oral health. You will independently perform a wide range of preventive and periodontal treatments, including scaling and polishing, fluoride applications, sealants, dental X-rays, and dental impressions. Working closely with dentists and dental assistants, you will deliver high-quality patient care while educating and motivating patients to adopt healthy oral hygiene habits. This is a hands-on role where your expertise, communication skills, and patient-centered approach make a real difference every day.

Requirements:
- A diploma in Oral Health Care / Dental Hygiene;
- Minimum B1 level English and willing to learn the Dutch language;
- A completed Hepatitis B titer test;
- A valid X-ray certificate;

What we offer:
- A salary (with Dutch registration) between €3400 and €5000 gross per month, depending on qualifications, experience and competencies;
- Annual contract (32 - 40 hours p/w) with intention for a permanent contract;
- Travel allowance;
- Excellent secondary conditions;
- Paid vacation days plus 8% holiday allowance;
- Staff discounts
- Team activities and a pleasant, professional working environment;
- Support in finding accommodation in The Netherlands;

Would you like to work in a modern dental practice where prevention, periodontal care, and teamwork are central?

For more information about the process of recognition of your foreign diploma and the possibilities to work during that period, please send an email to: melvin.zalmijn@uwv.nl
